    {
      "subject": "Grand Inquisitor",
      "relation": "MEMBER_OF",
      "object": "Roman Church",
      "quote": "He is not dressed in his gorgeous cardinal’s robes, as he was the day before, when he was burning the enemies of the Roman Church",
      "disputed": false,
      "first_revealed_index": 36,
      "doc_id": "ch036",
      "label_ko": "5편 5장"
    },
    {
      "subject": "Grand Inquisitor",
      "relation": "LIVES_AT",
      "object": "Seville",
      "quote": "My story is laid in Spain, in Seville, in the most terrible time of the Inquisition",
      "disputed": false,
      "first_revealed_index": 36,
      "doc_id": "ch036",
      "label_ko": "5편 5장"
    },
    {
      "subject": "Grand Inquisitor",
      "relation": "PRESENT_AT",
      "object": "Auto da Fé",
      "quote": "burnt by the cardinal, the Grand Inquisitor, in a magnificent _auto da fé_, in the presence of the king, the court, the knights, the cardinals, the most charming ladies of the court, and the whole population of Seville.",
      "disputed": false,
      "first_revealed_index": 36,
      "doc_id": "ch036",
      "label_ko": "5편 5장"
    },
    {
      "subject": "Auto da Fé",
      "relation": "OCCURRED_AT",
      "object": "Seville",
      "quote": "burnt by the cardinal, the Grand Inquisitor, in a magnificent _auto da fé_, in the presence of the king, the court, the knights, the cardinals, the most charming ladies of the court, and the whole population of Seville.",
      "disputed": false,
      "first_revealed_index": 36,
      "doc_id": "ch036",
      "label_ko": "5편 5장"
    },
    {
      "subject": "Grand Inquisitor",
      "relation": "QUARRELS_WITH",
      "object": "Jesus Christ",
      "quote": "to-morrow I shall condemn Thee and burn Thee at the stake as the worst of heretics.",
      "disputed": false,
      "first_revealed_index": 36,
      "doc_id": "ch036",
      "label_ko": "5편 5장"
    },
    {
      "subject": "Jesus Christ",
      "relation": "LIVES_AT",
      "object": "Palace of the Holy Inquisition",
      "quote": "The guards lead their prisoner to the close, gloomy vaulted prison in the ancient palace of the Holy Inquisition and shut Him in it.",
      "disputed": false,
      "first_revealed_index": 36,
      "doc_id": "ch036",
      "label_ko": "5편 5장"
    },
    {
      "subject": "Jesus Christ",
      "relation": "LIVES_AT",
      "object": "Russia",
      "quote": "Bearing the Cross, in slavish dress, Weary and worn, the Heavenly King Our mother, Russia, came to bless, And through our land went wandering.",
      "disputed": false,
      "first_revealed_index": 36,
      "doc_id": "ch036",
      "label_ko": "5편 5장"
    },
    {
      "subject": "God",
      "relation": "FATHER_OF",
      "object": "Son of God",
      "quote": "and Thou shalt know then whether Thou art the Son of God and shalt prove then how great is Thy faith in Thy Father.",
      "disputed": true,
      "first_revealed_index": 36,
      "doc_id": "ch036",
      "label_ko": "5편 5장"
    },
    {
      "subject": "Ivan",
      "relation": "BROTHER_OF",
      "object": "Alyosha",
      "quote": "He fancied besides that his brother was looking at him ironically.",
      "disputed": false,
      "first_revealed_index": 36,
      "doc_id": "ch036",
      "label_ko": "5편 5장"
    },
    {
      "subject": "Father Païssy",
      "relation": "MENTOR_OF",
      "object": "Alyosha",
      "quote": "Is that Father Païssy’s teaching?” “No, no, on the contrary, Father Païssy did once say something rather the same as you",
      "disputed": false,
      "first_revealed_index": 36,
      "doc_id": "ch036",
      "label_ko": "5편 5장"
    },
    {
      "subject": "Ivan",
      "relation": "MEMBER_OF",
      "object": "Masons",
      "quote": "“You are perhaps a Mason yourself!” broke suddenly from Alyosha.",
      "disputed": true,
      "first_revealed_index": 36,
      "doc_id": "ch036",
      "label_ko": "5편 5장"
    },
    {
      "subject": "The Grand Inquisitor",
      "relation": "QUARRELS_WITH",
      "object": "Jesus",
      "quote": "I repeat, to-morrow Thou shalt see that obedient flock who at a sign from me will hasten to heap up the hot cinders about the pile on which I shall burn Thee for coming to hinder us.",
